#: localenum.cpp:170
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can define the decimal separator used to display numbers (i.e. a "
"dot or a comma in most countries).</p><p>Note that the decimal separator "
"used to display monetary values has to be set separately (see the 'Money' "
"tab).</p>"
msgstr ""

#: localenum.cpp:179
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can define the thousands separator used to display numbers.</"
"p><p>Note that the thousands separator used to display monetary values has "
"to be set separately (see the 'Money' tab).</p>"
msgstr ""

#: localenum.cpp:187
msgid ""
"Here you can specify text used to prefix positive numbers. Most people leave "
"this blank."
msgstr ""
"Li vê derê tu dikarî nîşaneya ku wê li pêşiya hejmarê zêdek were bikaranîn "
"diyar bike. Gelek kes vala dihêle."

#: localenum.cpp:193
msgid ""
"Here you can specify text used to prefix negative numbers. This should not "
"be empty, so you can distinguish positive and negative numbers. It is "
"normally set to minus (-)."
msgstr ""
"Li vê derê tu dikarî nîşaneyên ku wê li pêşiya hejmarê kêmek were bikaranîn "
"hilbijêrî. Divê ev cih vala neyê hiştin da ku hejmarên kêmek ji hev werine "
"cihêkirin. Piranî mîhengî nîşaneya kêmek (-) dibe."

